{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47015","headline":"读李白集 · 齐己","name":"读李白集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竭云涛，刳巨鳌，搜括造化空牢牢。\n冥心入海海神怖，骊龙不敢爲珠主。\n人间物象不供取，饱饮游神向悬圃。\n锵金铿玉千余篇，脍吞炙嚼人口传。\n须知一一丈夫气，不是绮罗儿女言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}